# punch-prediction skill environment variables
#
# Copy to .env in THIS folder, or in your project's working directory.
# Resolution order: CWD/.env → ~/.claude/skills/cross-prediction/.env → prompt.
#
# Permissions: chmod 600 .env

# REQUIRED — the wallet address of your account on punch.win
WALLET_ADDRESS=0x...

# OPTIONAL — which market to act on. Live markets:
#   usd   — real money, collateral pONEUSD (Wrapped Prediction ONEUSD)
#   point — free to play, collateral POINT, with daily claim + weekly season
# Read commands default to usd; write commands default to point (free).
# Override per command with --market=usd | --market=point.
# PRED_MARKET=point

# OPTIONAL — pick the signing strategy. Leave unset for "auto" (A → C by precedence).
#   A: local viem signer (requires PRIVATE_KEY).  Full control; required for claims.
#   C: CROSSx gateway remote signer (requires PIN + configured gateway).
#      Signs payloads only — cannot submit on-chain transactions, so it cannot
#      run claim / enter-season / redeem.
# STRATEGY=A

# Strategy A — set via local signer config for a disposable wallet.
# PRIVATE_KEY is read from this local file or process env only; never paste it into chat or argv.

# Strategy C — your 6-digit CROSSx service PIN.
# PIN=123456

# Strategy C only — gateway auth token supplied through a secure local channel.
# CROSSX_AUTH_TOKEN=...
# CROSSX_GATEWAY_BASE=https://embedded-wallet-gateway.crosstoken.io/api/v1

# OPTIONAL — per-market trade caps. Rejects any single buy/sell above the cap.
# Real money and free money get separate caps on purpose.
MAX_TRADE_ONEUSD=10
MAX_TRADE_POINT=1000

# OPTIONAL — endpoint overrides
# CROSS_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.crosstoken.io:22001/
# PRED_API_USD=https://pred-usd-service-api.crossdefi.io/api/v1
# PRED_API_POINT=https://point-service-api.punch.win/api/v1
# PRED_ORIGIN=https://www.punch.win
# CROSS_AUTH_BASE=https://cross-auth.crosstoken.io/cross-auth
